### n8n Error Handling Configuration

Every HTTP Request node in n8n should be configured with:

| Setting | Value | Why |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Retry on Fail** | `true` | Network blips, API rate limits |
| **Max Retries** | `3` | Don't hammer a dead service |
| **Wait Between Retries** | `5000ms` (exponential) | Back off gracefully |
| **Continue on Fail** | `true` (for scraping) | One bad URL shouldn't kill the batch |
| **Continue on Fail** | `false` (for production push) | NEVER silently skip a failed DB write |

