### Three Update Actions for the Reviewer

| Action | What It Does | API Call |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **🔄 Apply Selected Updates** | Only sends the changed fields (units, prices, possession) to the update API. Unchanged fields are left alone. | `PUT /project/:matched_project_id` with partial payload |
| **✅ Full Replace & Push** | Replaces ALL project data (units, medias, features, etc.) with the freshly scraped version. Use when the source has significantly more/better data. | `PUT /project/:matched_project_id` with full payload |
| **❌ Skip** | The existing data is fine, no update needed. Mark staged record as `status: 'duplicate'`. | No API call. Update staging record only. |

### Production Push — Update API Mapping

Your existing [`updateProject`](file:///c:/Users/Mark/Desktop/JustFlip/Portal-Service/controllers/portal/project.controller.js#L25-L190) endpoint at `PUT /project/:id` already handles everything we need:

```javascript
