// 1. Finds the project by ID
// 2. Uses updateIfChanged() — only modifies fields that are different
// 3. Re-generates slug if name/builder/city/location changed
// 4. REPLACES units, medias, features, FAQs, amenities via destroy + bulkCreate
// 5. Resets approval to 'pending' and status to 'inactive' (safety net!)
// 6. All in a single transaction — atomic, safe
```

**The update payload sent to `PUT /project/:id`:**

```json
